Subject: [PATCH 37/37] Rabin: review edits E1-E3 (rabin delivery review)

E1: cite Mathlib's Fin.appendEquiv instead of the private copy rabin_appendEquiv.
E2: prove rabin_pushesUniform_prod from the library's PushesUniform.prodMap,
pushesUniform_id and PushesUniform.uprob_eq.
